00:06:41.337 --> 00:06:42.277
or do you want me to go?

00:06:42.277 --> 00:06:43.182
- You go, and I'll add.

00:06:43.182 --> 00:06:45.945
- You know, to me, it's pretty easy.

00:06:45.945 --> 00:06:48.243
There's only those two
things at some level,

00:06:48.243 --> 00:06:50.322
and so I think what you do first is,

00:06:50.322 --> 00:06:54.176
if you're unsure, you
change your entire marketing

00:06:54.176 --> 00:06:57.136
approach, and I would
say you do that twice.

00:06:57.136 --> 00:07:00.539
So, over a 12-to-24 month period,

00:07:00.539 --> 00:07:02.813
you change your marketing
approach radically.

00:07:02.813 --> 00:07:05.982
If you go oh-for-three, there's chances

00:07:05.982 --> 00:07:07.642
