00:07:14.538 --> 00:07:17.174
or your crappy wine that you made.

00:07:17.174 --> 00:07:20.482
So, the other thing to do is
to look at your lifetime value

00:07:20.482 --> 00:07:22.091
and repeat business.

00:07:22.091 --> 00:07:25.335
One of the reasons I know
that Wine Library works,

00:07:25.335 --> 00:07:26.683
